    {
        id napi-model-range-operands
        title "JavaScript's model and registered column comparisons accept a Range or Multirange value in their types, as their runtime does"
        kind @fix
        sealed true
        log (
            {
                at 2026-11-01T12:27:53.759868Z
                author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                kind @note
                text "Found by napi-model-created-multirange (merged 98fd2ce5): a JavaScript model column's comparison types accept no bare Range or Multirange, so a test filtering a created-multirange column had to wrap the value in new Value(hours, kind). The runtime converts a Range or Multirange through the column's declared kind; the declarations in pgorm-napi/lib/models.d.ts and entities.d.ts should accept the value types each range and multirange kind takes, with deno check cases proving a range column takes one and a scalar column refuses it. Check whether Python's stubs have the same gap."
            }

            {
                at 2026-11-01T12:45:09.520047Z
                author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                kind @decision
                text "Expr's value-taking methods take their operand through the receiver (eq<S>(this: S, other: ComparisonOperand<S> | Quantified), and ModelOperand<S> for between, distinctness, containment, overlap and the range positions), and ModelColumn / EntityColumn carry their operand type as a #private-branded phantom instead of redeclaring the methods. A column override taking a Range (no Operand) is refused by TypeScript (TS2416) and leaves the column unassignable to Expr; a never-typed overload per method would also pass but adds a visible overload to every method and breaks calls on a union of columns. FieldOperand and ColumnOperand now exclude only null from the kind's input type rather than extracting the Operand subset, which also admits a vector column's Float32Array, as the runtime converts it. Python needs no change: ModelColumn and EntityColumn type every value operand Any."
            }

            {
                at 2026-11-01T13:23:56.003973Z
                author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                kind @status
                text "Doing → Done (nplan complete)"
            }
        )
    }

